00:17:39,929 --> 00:17:43,929
踵打ち鳴らせ どうぞ 心の踊る方へさ
Stamp your heels, please, toward where your heart dances.

150
00:17:43,929 --> 00:17:47,829
錆びないさ こちらへどうぞ 鼓動の鳴る方へさ
Fearless, come this way, toward the beating of our hearts.

151
00:17:47,829 --> 00:17:51,829
踵打ち鳴らせ どうぞ 心の踊る方へさ
Stamp your heels, please, toward where your heart dances.

152
00:17:51,829 --> 00:17:55,829
空飛ぶ列車に飛び乗って 逆しまの世界踊り尽くせ
Jump onto a flying train and dance your heart out in the upside-down world.

153
00:17:56,229 --> 00:18:00,129
ねえ お願い 誰も知らない名もない今をかけてゆくの
Hey, please, running toward an unknown, nameless present,

154
00:18:00,129 --> 00:18:04,229
あの見果てぬ手を目を伸ばして
reaching out our hands to that unseen horizon.

155
00:18:04,229 --> 00:18:08,129
ねえ お願い 君を知りたい 声にならない臆病な朝を
Hey, please, I want to know you, through a timid, voiceless morning,

156
00:18:08,129 --> 00:18:12,129
たとえ何度迎えようとも
no matter how many times we face it.

157
00:18:16,129 --> 00:18:20,029
夢ならば覚めないで 現実なんてさ魅力もないから
If it's a dream, don't wake up, because reality holds no charm.

158
00:18:24,829 --> 00:18:28,229
時は誰も待ってくれないの
Time won't wait for anyone.

159
00:18:55,129 --> 00:19:01,929
蒼き光をともす それは破壊、眠り、ソセイ... ゲシュペンスター・イェーガー
Lighting the blue light—that is destruction, sleep, resurrection... Gespenst Jäger.

160
00:19:02,029 --> 00:19:09,229
傷つきさまよい踏み出した 確かな忍び逢い... ゲシュペンスター・イェーガー
A sure, stealthy rendezvous stepping out through injuries and wandering... Gespenst Jäger.

161
00:19:09,329 --> 00:19:12,229
ああ その背中は
Ah, that back

162
00:19:12,529 --> 00:19:16,229
羽根をもぎ取られた跡がある
bears the traces of having its wings torn off.

163
00:19:17,729 --> 00:19:23,129
小さな何かを信じて もう一度掴もう!
Believing in something small, let's grasp it once more!

164
00:19:23,729 --> 00:19:29,329
赤く激しく鼓動の鋼、痛み、そして揺れる... ゲシュペンスター・イェーガー
Red and intense, the steel of a heartbeat, pain, and trembling... Gespenst Jäger.

165
00:19:30,829 --> 00:19:37,429
どんな外皮をも切り裂き 立ち割るため立ち上がれ!... ゲシュペンスター・イェーガー
Rise up to slash through any outer skin and split it apart!... Gespenst Jäger.

166
00:19:38,229 --> 00:19:44,029
誇りを持ち刃振り上げ 私よあなたよその手よ
With pride, raise your blade—me, you, that hand,

167
00:19:44,029 --> 00:19:51,829
この手は安らぎを知っている!
this hand knows peace!

168
00:19:53,029 --> 00:19:55,029
non それでいい
Non, that's fine.

169
00:19:55,129 --> 00:19:58,029
non 希望涙
Non, hope and tears.

170
00:19:58,129 --> 00:20:03,529
せめて君の微笑み守るよ...
At the very least, I will protect your smile...

171
00:20:05,406 --> 00:20:07,186
青い惑星に生まれて
Born on a blue planet,

172
00:20:07,186 --> 00:20:09,036
違う道を歩いて
walking different paths,

173
00:20:09,286 --> 00:20:11,186
たどり着いたこの街
we arrived at this city

174
00:20:11,186 --> 00:20:12,986
光る粒が弾けた
where glowing particles burst forth.

175
00:20:30,886 --> 00:20:32,836
巡る夜にキミと出会い
Meeting you in the revolving night,

176
00:20:32,836 --> 00:20:34,686
いつの間にか手をつないで
before I knew it, we were holding hands.

177
00:20:34,686 --> 00:20:36,986
笑い声と弾む足で
With laughter and a bouncing step,

178
00:20:36,986 --> 00:20:38,286
どこまでも走れるミッドナイト
we can run anywhere through the midnight.

179
00:20:38,286 --> 00:20:40,386
見上げた空星の光
Starlight in the sky I looked up at,

180
00:20:40,386 --> 00:20:42,486
街のネオンが混ざり合って
blending with the city's neon lights.

181
00:20:42,486 --> 00:20:44,986
憂鬱な日々を忘れて
Forgetting these gloomy days,

182
00:20:44,986 --> 00:20:47,586
痛い・辛いとか、苦い・暗いはもう全部捨て去って
throwing away all the pain and bitterness!

183
00:20:48,186 --> 00:20:50,186
ボクらもっと自由なはず
We should be much freer.

184
00:20:50,186 --> 00:20:52,886
閉ざした羽を開いたなら
If we open our closed wings,

185
00:20:52,886 --> 00:20:55,186
退屈な日々にさよなら
say goodbye to boring days,

186
00:20:55,186 --> 00:20:57,886
夜の街を行こう
and let's go into the night city!

187
00:20:58,886 --> 00:21:00,886
ビルを抜けて 街を追い越して
Passing through buildings and overtaking the town,

188
00:21:00,886 --> 00:21:02,986
さらば青い惑星
farewell to the blue planet!

189
00:21:02,986 --> 00:21:05,486
なんて惚けてどこまで行こう
How dazed, how far shall we go?

190
00:21:05,486 --> 00:21:08,186
変わらないものなど何もないから
Since nothing ever stays the same,

191
00:21:08,186 --> 00:21:12,536
たった一つ 確かな今を刻んで
carve out just one certain present moment.

192
00:21:12,886 --> 00:21:14,986
踊る夜にキミを連れて
Bringing you along into the dancing night,

193
00:21:14,986 --> 00:21:17,186
邪魔なものは何もなくて
with nothing in our way,

194
00:21:17,186 --> 00:21:19,386
歌う声と軽い足で
with a singing voice and light steps,

195
00:21:19,386 --> 00:21:23,886
いつまでも走れるミッドナイト
we can run forever through the midnight.

196
00:21:24,086 --> 00:21:26,386
見上げた空月の光
Moonlight in the sky I looked up at,

197
00:21:26,386 --> 00:21:28,286
街の幻想が惹かれあって
blending with the city's illusions.

198
00:21:28,286 --> 00:21:30,586
憂鬱な日々を忘れて
Forgetting these gloomy days,

199
00:21:30,586 --> 00:21:32,536
痛い・辛いとか、苦い・暗いはもう全部捨て去って
throwing away all the pain and darkness!

200
00:21:32,536 --> 00:21:34,686
見上げた空星の光
Starlight in the sky I looked up at,

201
00:21:34,686 --> 00:21:37,036
街のネオンが混ざり合って
blending with the city's neon lights.

202
00:21:37,036 --> 00:21:39,586
退屈な日々にさよなら
Say goodbye to boring days,

203
00:21:39,586 --> 00:21:43,886
守るよ
I will protect you.

204
00:21:49,286 --> 00:21:51,886
ボクらもっと自由なはず
We should be much freer.

205
00:21:51,886 --> 00:21:54,686
閉ざした羽を開いたなら
If we open our closed wings,

206
00:21:54,686 --> 00:21:57,286
退屈な日々にさよなら
say goodbye to boring days,

207
00:21:57,286 --> 00:22:00,086
夜の街を行こう
and let's go into the night city!

208
00:22:00,386 --> 00:22:05,286
せめて君の方へ 微笑みに希望なのだから
At least toward you, into your smile, because it's hope.

209
00:22:09,286 --> 00:22:14,586
守るよ それでいいの
I'll protect you, that's fine.

210
00:22:15,586 --> 00:22:20,086
守るよ それでいいの
I'll protect you, that's fine.

211
00:22:21,186 --> 00:22:27,286
せめて君の方へ 微笑みに希望なのだから
At least toward you, into your smile, because it's hope.

212
00:22:29,086 --> 00:22:35,086
守るよ それでいいの
I'll protect you, that's fine.

213
00:23:00,686 --> 00:23:04,886
この声が聞こえるなら 渡り鳥よ導いて
If this voice can be heard, migratory birds, guide me.

214
00:23:05,086 --> 00:23:12,586
命が覚えている 遥かなるあの場所へ
To that distant place where life awakens.

215
00:23:13,086 --> 00:23:17,286
海鳴り 心が怯えに捕らえぬように
Sound of the sea, so my heart isn't caught by fear.

216
00:23:17,286 --> 00:23:20,286
歌って あなたの生まれた国の言葉で
Sing in the language of the country where you were born.

217
00:23:22,586 --> 00:23:27,286
あの場所へ...
To that place...

218
00:23:38,486 --> 00:23:41,586
海鳴り 心が
Sound of the sea, my heart

219
00:23:41,586 --> 00:23:45,286
恐れにとらわれぬように
so that it is not caught by fear.

220
00:23:45,286 --> 00:23:51,286
歌って あなたの生まれた国の言葉で
Sing in the language of the country where you were born.

221
00:24:03,586 --> 00:24:12,586
巡り合えれば 見つめ合えば 巡り合えれ
If we meet again, if we gaze at each other...

222
00:24:13,086 --> 00:24:20,586
瞳の中 同じ希望の光を灯している
Lighting the same fire of hope in our eyes.

223
00:24:24,086 --> 00:24:30,286
まだ見ぬかの地野の花は
The flowers of that unseen land

224
00:24:30,286 --> 00:24:36,286
まるで鈴の音の響き
are just like the chiming of small bells.

225
00:24:36,586 --> 00:24:42,586
西へと向かう風に 憧れよ はばたいて
To the wind heading west, yearning, spread your wings.

226
00:24:46,086 --> 00:24:49,586
はばたいて
Spread your wings.

227
00:25:00,455 --> 00:25:03,430
君の大好きなこの旋律(Melodie)...
This melody that you dearly loved...

228
00:25:03,430 --> 00:25:06,030
大空へと響け口琴(Harmonica)...
A harmonica resounding throughout the skies...

229
00:25:06,530 --> 00:25:08,830
天使が抱いた窓枠の画布(Toile)...
The canvas on your windowsill...

230
00:25:08,830 --> 00:25:12,130
ねえ... その風景画(Paysage)... 美しいかしら?
Hey... Is that landscape painting... beautiful?

231
00:25:12,430 --> 00:25:16,130
其れは(C'est)―― 風が運んだ...
That is— Carried by the wind...

232
00:25:16,130 --> 00:25:18,530
淡い花弁... 春の追想...
The light petals... The remembrance of spring...

233
00:25:18,530 --> 00:25:24,530
綺麗な音... 謳う少女(Monica)... 鳥の囀り... 針は進んだ →
What a beautiful sound... The singing girl... The chirping of the birds... The clock's hand moves →

234
00:25:25,130 --> 00:25:28,130
其れは(C'est)―― 蒼が繋いで...
That is— Connecting azure...

235
00:25:28,130 --> 00:25:31,530
流れる雲... 夏の追想...
The flowing clouds... The remembrance of summer...

236
00:25:31,530 --> 00:25:36,830
綺麗な音... 詠う少女(Monica)... 蜩の時雨... 針は進んだ →
What a beautiful sound... The singing girl... The shower of cicadas... The clock's hand moves →

237
00:25:44,530 --> 00:25:47,530
綺麗だと... 君が言った景色...
The scenery you said was...

238
00:25:47,530 --> 00:25:51,830
きっと忘れない...
beautiful... I won't forget...

239
00:25:51,830 --> 00:25:56,130
『美しいもの』... 集める為に... 生命はやって来る......
In order to gather... 『Beautiful things』... Life comes to be—

240
00:25:56,530 --> 00:26:03,130
君が抱きしめた短い季節(Saison)... 痛みの雨に打たれながら...
The short season you embraced... All while being pelted by the rain of pain...

241
00:26:03,130 --> 00:26:10,530
「心配ないよ」... 笑って言った... 君の様相(Visage)忘れないよ......
“Don't worry”... You said while smiling... I'll never forget that visage of yours...

242
00:26:10,830 --> 00:26:14,330
其れは(C'est)―― 夜の窓辺に...
That is— Smiling down at the windowsill...

243
00:26:14,330 --> 00:26:17,130
微笑む月... 秋の追想...
The moon at night... The remembrance of autumn...

244
00:26:17,130 --> 00:26:22,530
綺麗な音... 詠う少女(Monica)... 虫の羽音... 針は進んだ →
What a beautiful sound... The singing girl... The buzzing of the bugs... The clock's hand moves →

245
00:26:23,330 --> 00:26:26,530
其れは(C'est)―― 大地を包み...
That is— Covering the ground...

246
00:26:26,530 --> 00:26:29,530
微睡む雪... 冬の追想...
The napping snow... The remembrance of winter...

247
00:26:29,530 --> 00:26:35,330
綺麗な音... 詩う少女(Monica)... 時の木枯し... 針は進んだ →
What a beautiful sound... The singing girl... The cold wind of time... The clock's hand moves →

248
00:26:35,530 --> 00:26:39,830
綺麗だね... 君が生きた景色...
How beautiful... The scenery you've lived through...

249
00:26:39,830 --> 00:26:46,330
ずっと忘れない... 『美しいもの』... 集める為に... 生命は過ぎて行く......
I will never forget... In order to gather 『Beautiful things』... Life passes away—

250
00:26:46,830 --> 00:26:53,130
君が駆け抜けた眩しい季節(Saison)... 病の焚に灼かれながら...
The dazzling season you ran through... All while being burnt by the flames of sickness...

251
00:26:53,130 --> 00:27:02,330
「嗚呼... 綺麗だね」... 笑って逝った... 君の面影(Image)忘れないよ......
“Ah... How beautiful”... You died while smiling... I'll never forget that image of yours...

252
00:27:03,330 --> 00:27:08,830
君が生まれた朝... 泣き虫だった私は... 小さくても姉となった――
The morning of your birth... I was still a crybaby... Though I was small, I became a big sister—

253
00:27:08,830 --> 00:27:14,830
嬉しくて... 少し照れ臭くて... とても誇らしかった......
I was so happy... And slightly embarrassed... But so very proud...

254
00:27:15,130 --> 00:27:19,830
苦しみに揺蕩う生存の荒野を
The fields of life filled with suffering

255
00:27:19,830 --> 00:27:24,330
『美しいもの』探すように駆け抜けた
We roam them in search of 『beautiful things』

256
00:27:24,330 --> 00:27:29,830
果てしなき地平へ 旅立つ君の 寝顔何より美しいと思ったよ......
The sleeping face of yours when you set off towards the boundless horizon / I thought that was more beautiful than anything else...

257
00:27:30,330 --> 00:27:33,530
君の大好きなこの旋律(Melodie)...
This melody that you dearly loved...

258
00:27:33,530 --> 00:27:36,130
大空へと響け口琴(Harmonica)...
A harmonica resounding throughout the skies...

259
00:27:36,530 --> 00:27:38,830
天使が抱いた窓枠の画布(Toile)...
The canvas on your windowsill...

260
00:27:38,830 --> 00:27:42,130
ねえ... その風景画(Paysage)... 美しいかしら?
Hey... Is that landscape painting... beautiful?

261
00:27:42,330 --> 00:27:49,330
「私は世界で一番美しい光をみた その数を胸に抱いて Laurent の分も歌い続けよう...」
“I saw the most beautiful light in this world. I'll hold that flower to my chest, and sing for Laurent as well...”

262
00:28:15,530 --> 00:28:19,830
この世界は非現実 ただ刷り込まれたビジョン
This world is unreal, just an implanted vision.

263
00:28:19,830 --> 00:28:26,330
無限遠点 価値観を今 上書きする 変哲のない宇宙
Overwriting the infinite focal point and values now — a featureless universe.

264
00:28:26,330 --> 00:28:31,330
傲慢な神は 目に映らない 光速度で 支配続けるならば
If an arrogant god rules at the speed of light, invisible to the eye,

265
00:28:31,330 --> 00:28:35,330
僕は 僕だけは 奇跡的で 致命的な 少数派で結構
I—only I—will be a miraculous, fatal minority.

266
00:28:35,330 --> 00:28:37,330
I can fly high

267
00:28:37,530 --> 00:28:43,330
あの瞬間、あの場面が キミにとって特別なら
That moment, that scene, if it was special to you,

268
00:28:43,330 --> 00:28:47,330
過去は離れて 行くものなんかじゃなくて
The past isn't just something that drifts away,

269
00:28:47,330 --> 00:28:52,830
傷付く事の痛みより 大事なシーン その全ての ヒカリが今ゼロを生む
Rather than the pain of getting hurt, every important scene—its light now creates zero.

270
00:28:59,330 --> 00:29:02,330
この命という夢幻 まだ錯覚とも知らず
This illusion called life, still unaware it might be an illusion,

271
00:29:02,330 --> 00:29:07,330
二律背反 パラドックスさえ 限界のない 世界線で欺き
Deceiving even antinomies and paradoxes on a boundless worldline,

272
00:29:07,330 --> 00:29:12,330
感情の支配 軌道秩序は 常識さえ すり替えて行くならば
If emotional rule and orbital order are replacing even common sense,

273
00:29:12,330 --> 00:29:17,330
僕の 僕だけの 苦しみさえ 欠損さえ 維持する運命の法則
Even my own suffering, even my flaws—the laws of fate maintain them.

274
00:29:17,330 --> 00:29:19,330
I can fly high

275
00:29:19,330 --> 00:29:24,330
愛のしるし、愛の言葉、明確なるこの記憶を
Signs of love, words of love, this crystal-clear memory

276
00:29:24,330 --> 00:29:28,330
二度と彼方に 置き去りにはしないから
I will never leave behind in the distance again.

277
00:29:28,330 --> 00:29:32,330
いつでもまだキミのそばに 隣り合わせ その量子が もつれ合えばゼロになる
Always still by your side, side by side, when those quanta become entangled, they become zero.

278
00:29:40,330 --> 00:29:44,330
まだ知らない 新しい空 世界線へ繋ぐのさ
Connecting to a new sky, a worldline we don't yet know.

279
00:29:44,330 --> 00:29:46,330
I can fly high

280
00:29:46,330 --> 00:29:51,330
あの瞬間、あの場面が キミにとって特別なら
That moment, that scene, if it was special to you,

281
00:29:51,330 --> 00:29:55,330
過去は離れて 行くものなんかじゃなくて
The past isn't just something that drifts away,

282
00:29:55,330 --> 00:30:00,330
傷付く事の痛みより 大事なシーン その全ての ヒカリが今ゼロを生む
Rather than the pain of getting hurt, every important scene—its light now creates zero.

283
00:30:01,304 --> 00:30:02,774
一番輝く星が一度まわったら
When the brightest star spins around once,

284
00:30:02,894 --> 00:30:03,714
指を一本折った
I folded down one finger.

285
00:30:04,304 --> 00:30:06,634
前に見えるのは小さく握った
What I see before me are just

286
00:30:06,754 --> 00:30:08,954
ただ二つの拳だけ
two small clenched fists.

287
00:30:10,004 --> 00:30:13,334
振り返る想いはただ一つ
The feelings I look back on are just one.

288
00:30:14,324 --> 00:30:17,014
0の時をすぎて数えてみよう
Let's count past the zero point,

289
00:30:17,214 --> 00:30:19,734
あの頃の終わりで奏でる歌
a song played at the end of those days.

290
00:30:20,354 --> 00:30:22,834
この手で開かれる新たな始まりだった
It was a new beginning opened by these hands.

291
00:30:23,354 --> 00:30:25,384
運命と時間、相容れない
Fate and time cannot reconcile;

292
00:30:25,534 --> 00:30:26,894
絶体絶命、明日の息
desperate times, tomorrow's breath.

293
00:30:26,894 --> 00:30:28,354
I can fly!

294
00:30:28,354 --> 00:30:30,134
愛のしるし
The mark of love,

295
00:30:30,134 --> 00:30:31,234
愛の言葉
words of love,

296
00:30:31,234 --> 00:30:33,314
明確なるこの記憶を
make these memories crystal clear.

297
00:30:34,114 --> 00:30:38,284
二度と彼方に置き去りにはしないから
I will never leave them behind in the distant past,

298
00:30:38,664 --> 00:30:43,394
いつでもすぐ君のそばに寄り添わせ
so I will always stay close by your side,

299
00:30:43,604 --> 00:30:48,394
その両手がもうつめ合えばひとつになる
and if both our hands touch, we become one.

