burn the flame of life together!

606
00:59:32,654 --> 00:59:34,454
五感の全部が叫ぶ
all five senses scream,

607
00:59:35,587 --> 00:59:39,354
眩しく煌めいた友の証
a dazzling and brilliant proof of friendship!

608
00:59:46,320 --> 00:59:47,620
絆、心、一つに束ね
Unite our bonds and hearts as one,

609
00:59:49,320 --> 00:59:51,354
響き渡れ希望の音
let the sound of hope echo through!

610
00:59:51,854 --> 00:59:53,854
「信ずる事を諦めない」と
"Don't give up believing,"

611
00:59:53,987 --> 00:59:55,454
歌え可能性にゼロはない
sing it, there's no zero in possibilities!

612
00:59:58,454 --> 01:00:00,854
飛べよ この奇跡に光あれ
Fly into this miracle, let there be light!

